\\ plotting.6502 - main RAM's way into the data's bank: the sprites' plotter paged in for it (D9).

\\ Plot a sprite (sprite_plot, in the data's bank), the data's bank paged in for it and the code's back after.
\\
\\ Inputs:
\\     A: the sprite
\\     sprite_draw.col, sprite_draw.bottom: where it goes
\\     back: the playfield
\\
\\ Outputs:
\\     A, X, Y: corrupted

.plot_sprite
{
    LDX bankdata:STX &FE30              ; ROMSEL: the data's bank
    JSR sprite_plot
    LDA bankcode:STA &FE30              ; ROMSEL: the code's back
    RTS
}

\\ The tunnel's mouth (tunnel_mouth, in the code's bank) for draw_objects, the code's bank paged in for it.
\\
\\ Inputs:
\\     A: the row's line (RowYB)
\\
\\ Outputs:
\\     A, X, Y: corrupted

.draw_mouth
{
    LDX bankcode:STX &FE30              ; ROMSEL: the code's bank
    JSR tunnel_mouth
    LDX bankdata:STX &FE30              ; ROMSEL: the data's back
    RTS
}

\\ The roadside objects (draw_objects, in the data's bank), the data's bank paged in for them.
\\
\\ Inputs:
\\     the road's rows; back
\\
\\ Outputs:
\\     A, X, Y: corrupted

.plot_objects
{
    LDX bankdata:STX &FE30              ; ROMSEL: the data's bank
    JSR draw_objects
    LDA bankcode:STA &FE30              ; ROMSEL: the code's back
    RTS
}
